I0924 17:50:43.764113    2087 conn_opt.go:96] jsonrpc2: <-- result #52: conversation/chat/getHistory: {"history":[{"entity":"USER","markdownText":"i need to setup the github actions for opa pod created in this project ","chatSectionId":"0","ideContext":{"currentFile":{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/lineage-event.json","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"CURRENTLY_OPEN"},"remoteContexts":null,"remoteRepositories":null,"otherFiles":[{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/setuptools/__init__.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.gemini/extensions/vertex/README.md","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/sentry_sdk/integrations/logging.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/datahub/configuration/env_vars.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.gemini/skills/dataform-bigquery/SKILL.md","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.codeoss/data/User/globalStorage/googlecloudtools.datacloud/skill_bases/dataform-bigquery/SKILL.md","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.codeoss/data/User/globalStorage/googlecloudtools.datacloud/skill_bases/gcp-pipeline-orchestration/SKILL.md","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.gemini/skills/gcp-pipeline-orchestration/SKILL.md","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/setuptools/tests/fixtures.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.codeoss/data/User/globalStorage/googlecloudtools.datacloud/skill_bases/gcp-dataflow/SKILL.md","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"}],"rules":null,"editableRegion":null,"recentUserActions":null,"chatSectionId":"0"},"id":"10102e4b-608b-4f42-bf60-bf2bb70fb235","agentMetadata":{"coderAgent":{"kind":""},"model":""}},{"traceId":"bb06fc3e45341851","entity":"SYSTEM","markdownText":"To set up GitHub Actions for validating, formatting, and testing your Open Policy Agent (OPA) policies, you can create a continuous integration (CI) workflow. This workflow will trigger automatically on pushes and pull requests to ensure your Rego policies are syntactically correct, properly formatted, and pass any unit tests.\n\nHere is the unified diff to create the new GitHub Actions workflow file:\n\n```diff\n--- /dev/null\n+++ /home/mdbaddi/.github/workflows/opa-ci.yml\n@@ -0,0 +1,32 @@\n+name: OPA CI\n+\n+on:\n+  push:\n+    branches: [ main, master ]\n+  pull_request:\n+    branches: [ main, master ]\n+\n+jobs:\n+  opa-validation:\n+    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n+    steps:\n+      - name: Checkout code\n+        uses: actions/checkout@v4\n+\n+      - name: Setup OPA CLI\n+        uses: open-policy-agent/setup-opa@v2\n+        with:\n+          version: latest\n+\n+      - name: Check Rego Formatting\n+        run: |\n+          # Fails if any .rego files are not formatted according to 'opa fmt'\n+          opa fmt --fail .\n+\n+      - name: OPA Check (Syntax Validation)\n+        run: |\n+          opa check .\n+\n+      - name: Run OPA Tests\n+        run: |\n+          opa test . -v\n```\n\n### What this workflow does:\n1. **Triggering**: It runs on any push or pull request targeted at the `main` or `master` branches.\n2. **Setup**: It leverages the official `open-policy-agent/setup-opa` action to install the latest version of the OPA CLI in the runner environment.\n3. **Formatting Check**: Runs `opa fmt --fail .` to enforce consistent formatting standards across your Rego policies.\n4. **Syntax Validation**: Runs `opa check .` to catch syntax errors or reference errors early.\n5. **Unit Testing**: Runs `opa test . -v` to execute all defined policy unit tests and provide verbose output.\n\nMake sure to adjust the directory paths if your Rego policies are confined to a specific subdirectory (e.g., replacing `.` with `./policies`).\n\n\u003c!--\n[PROMPT_SUGGESTION]How can I add a step to build a Docker image for the OPA pod in this GitHub Action?[/PROMPT_SUGGESTION]\n[PROMPT_SUGGESTION]How do I write a basic unit test for an OPA rego policy?[/PROMPT_SUGGESTION]\n--\u003e","chatSectionId":"0","ideContext":{"currentFile":{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/lineage-event.json","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"CURRENTLY_OPEN"},"remoteContexts":null,"remoteRepositories":null,"otherFiles":[{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/setuptools/__init__.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.gemini/extensions/vertex/README.md","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/sentry_sdk/integrations/logging.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/datahub/configuration/env_vars.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.gemini/skills/dataform-bigquery/SKILL.md","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.codeoss/data/User/globalStorage/googlecloudtools.datacloud/skill_bases/dataform-bigquery/SKILL.md","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.codeoss/data/User/globalStorage/googlecloudtools.datacloud/skill_bases/gcp-pipeline-orchestration/SKILL.m