ur actual repository name, verifying the remote setup, and then pushing your changes to the `main` branch, including instructions on using a Personal Access Token for authentication.\n\n**Integrating GitHub Container Registry**\n\nI'm now considering how to enhance the CI/CD workflow by integrating with GitHub Container Registry. I'll provide a diff to update the OPA CI job, suggesting you push your container image to `ghcr.io` for better alignment with your GitHub setup.\n\n**Updating Container Registry Integration**\n\nI'm now focused on integrating the GitHub Container Registry for a more robust CI/CD workflow. I'll provide a diff to update the OPA CI job, directing you to push your container image to `ghcr.io`, aligned with your GitHub repository.\n\n","id":"3bf41990-f868-4577-b56d-de0896f2f6ba","agentMetadata":{"coderAgent":{"kind":""},"model":""},"codeBlockInfo":[{"historyItemId":"7334da4f5ec59460","codeBlockIndex":1,"isCollapsed":false}],"modelDisplayName":"3 Flash Preview","modelID":"chat-gemini-3-0-flash-preview-free-tier","usageMetadata":{"promptTokenCount":48776,"candidatesTokenCount":887,"totalTokenCount":49663}},{"entity":"USER","markdownText":"git remote -v show me nothing.. how can i add the remote to push the code ","chatSectionId":"6","ideContext":{"currentFile":{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.github/workflows/opa-ci.yml","language":"yaml","selection":{"start":1216,"end":1216},"includedReason":"CURRENTLY_OPEN"},"remoteContexts":null,"remoteRepositories":[],"otherFiles":[{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pip/_internal/vcs/git.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.codeoss/data/User/globalStorage/googlecloudtools.datacloud/skill_bases/gcp-composer-troubleshooting/SKILL.md","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.gemini/skills/gcp-composer-troubleshooting/SKILL.md","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end"