### Verification in GitHub
After you merge the Pull Request into `main`, the **CD** portion of your workflow (`opa-deploy`) will trigger. This will:
1.  Build your production OPA policy bundle.
2.  Log in to the GitHub Container Registry.
3.  Build and push a new Docker image for your OPA pod.

