iles**\n\nI'm now focusing on rectifying the `.cache` directory being tracked despite `.gitignore`. My plan is to use `git rm -r --cached .cache` to remove it from tracking, followed by a commit and push of this change. This should address the large file warning and its potential impact on PR creation.\n\n**Fixing Repository State**\n\nI'm now focusing on ensuring the `opa-ci.yml` workflow file is properly committed and that the `.cache` directory, which was unexpectedly tracked despite `.gitignore`, is removed from Git's tracking. I'll use `git rm --cached` to un-track these files and then push the corrected state.\n\n**Verifying Comparison Defaults**\n\nI'm now checking if GitHub's comparison defaults to `master` instead of `main`, as this could be why no changes appear. I'll advise confirming the comparison dropdowns.\n\n","id":"8ebd8b15-e029-4dda-bc26-abec9749f9c3","agentMetadata":{"coderAgent":{"kind":""},"model":""},"codeBlockInfo":[{"historyItemId":"19918aeedf79c77","codeBlockIndex":0,"isCollapsed":false},{"historyItemId":"19918aeedf79c77","codeBlockIndex":1,"isCollapsed":false}],"modelDisplayName":"3 Flash Preview","modelID":"chat-gemini-3-0-flash-preview-free-tier","usageMetadata":{"promptTokenCount":65641,"candidatesTokenCount":790,"totalTokenCount":66431}}],"threadId":"514d6fbe-b843-11f1-a27d-26ba507dde12","usageMetadata":{"promptTokenCount":65641,"candidatesTokenCount":790,"totalTokenCount":66431}}
