ine specifies where the job executes:\n\n```yaml\nruns-on: ubuntu-latest\n```\n\nWhen you use `ubuntu-latest`, `windows-latest`, or `macos-latest`, GitHub automatically provisions a fresh, temporary virtual machine (known as a **GitHub-hosted runner**) to execute your tasks. These servers are managed by GitHub, and they already have common tools installed, though the `open-policy-agent/setup-opa` action ensures the specific OPA CLI version you need is available.\n\nIf you ever needed to run this on your own private infrastructure instead, you would change that line to reference a \"self-hosted\" label that matches a runner you've installed on your own machine.\n\n\u003c!--\n[PROMPT_SUGGESTION]How can I configure this workflow to run on a self-hosted runner instead?[/PROMPT_SUGGESTION]\n[PROMPT_SUGGESTION]How do I add secret credentials to this GitHub Action for private OPA bundles?[/PROMPT_SUGGESTION]\n--\u003e","chatSectionId":"1","ideContext":{"currentFile":{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.github/workflows/opa-ci.yml","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"CURRENTLY_OPEN","isUntitled":false},"remoteContexts":null,"remoteRepositories":null,"otherFiles":[{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.codeoss/data/User/globalStorage/googlecloudtools.datacloud/skill_bases/google-cloud-storage-basics/references/mcp-usage.md","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE","isUntitled":false},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.gemini/skills/google-cloud-storage-basics/references/mcp-usage.md","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE","isUntitled":false},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/datahub/ingestion/source/mongodb.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE","isUntitled":false},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/datahub/cli/docker_cli.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE","isUntitled":false