i/extensions/vertex/README.md","/home/mdbaddi/.codeoss/data/User/globalStorage/googlecloudtools.datacloud/skill_bases/gcp-composer-troubleshooting/SKILL.md","/home/mdbaddi/.gemini/skills/gcp-composer-troubleshooting/SKILL.md","/home/mdbaddi/.codeoss/data/User/globalStorage/googlecloudtools.datacloud/skill_bases/dbt-bigquery/SKILL.md"]},"suggestedPrompts":["How do I create a GitHub Personal Access Token for Cloud Shell?","How can I check if my files were actually added to the commit?"],"thinkingSummaryMarkdownText":"**Resolving Git Push Error**\n\nI'm encountering a `src refspec main does not match any` error when trying to push to GitHub from Cloud Shell for the `odp-runtime` repository. I suspect an issue with the local branch name or a disconnected local repository. I'll investigate the current branch status and compare it to the remote.\n\n**Investigating Branch Mismatch**\n\nI'm digging into why my `git push` is failing with a `src refspec main does not match any` error. My current hypothesis is that my local branch isn't actually named `main`, possibly being `master` instead, or that I haven't committed anything yet. I'll verify the local branch name first.\n\n","id":"ffd95417-a28e-4790-8b6a-584d348abc00","agentMetadata":{"coderAgent":{"kind":""},"model":""},"modelDisplayName":"3 Flash Preview","modelID":"chat-gemini-3-0-flash-preview-free-tier","usageMetadata":{"promptTokenCount":48158,"candidatesTokenCount":489,"totalTokenCount":48647}},{"entity":"USER","markdownText":"mdbaddi@cloudshell:~ (tgs-int-odp-dev-001)$ git branch \r\n* test-opa-ci\r\nmdbaddi@cloudshell:~ (tgs-int-odp-dev-001)$ git push -u origin test-opa-ci^C\r\nmdbaddi@cloudshell:~ (tgs-int-odp-dev-001)$ git push -u origin master\r\nerror: src refspec master does not match any\r\nerror: failed to push some refs to 'https://github.com/Manjuanthtek/odp-runtime.git'\r\nmdbaddi@cloudshell:~ (tgs-int-odp-dev-001)$","chatSectionId":"8","ideContext":{"currentFile":{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.github/workflows/opa-ci.yml","language":"yaml","selection":{"start":1216,"end":1216},"includedReason":"CURRENTLY_OPEN","isUntitled":false},"remoteContexts":null,"remoteRepositories":[],"otherFiles":[{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pip/_internal/vcs/git.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE","isUntitled":false},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/datahub/configuration/git.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE","isUntitled":false},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/datahub/ingestion/source/git/git_import.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE","isUntitled":false},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.gemini/extensions/vertex/README.md","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE","isUntitled":false},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/datahub/cli/quickstart_versioning.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE","isUntitled":false},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pip/_internal/vcs/git.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE","isUntitled":false},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.gemini/extensions/vertex/README.md","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE","isUntitled":false},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.codeoss/data/User/globalStorage/googlecloudtools.datacloud/skill_bases/gcp-composer-troubleshooting/SKILL.md","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE","isUntitled":false},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.gemini/skills/gcp-composer-troubleshooting/SKILL.md","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE","isUntitled":false},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pip/_internal/vcs/versioncontrol.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE","isUntitled":false}],"rules":null,"editableRegion":null,"recentUserActions":null,"chatSectionId":"8"},"id":"1c5e24e2-6121-4681-9a98-6098b389dc20","agentMetadata":{"coderAgent":{"kind":""},"model":""}},{"traceId":"a5ad5eee27f305d3","entity":"SYSTEM","markdownText":"The error `error: src refspec master does not match any` happens because you are currently on a branch named `test-opa-ci`, but you told Git to push a branch named `master`. Since a branch named `master` doesn't exist in your local environment, Git doesn't know what to send to GitHub.\n\nTo fix this and get your code pushed, you have two options depending on what you want to achieve:\n\n### Option 1: Push your current test branch\nSince your current branch is `test-opa-ci`, you should push that specific branch. This is the best way to test your CI pipeline via a Pull Request.\n\n```bash\ngit push -u origin test-opa-ci\n```\n\nOnce this is pushed, you can go to your GitHub repository at `https://github.com/Manjuanthtek/odp-runtime` and create a **Pull Request** from `test-opa-ci` to `main`. This will trigger the `opa-validation` job in your `/home/mdbaddi/.github/workflows/opa-ci.yml` workflow.\n\n### Option 2: Rename your branch to `main` and push\nIf you intended for this code to be your primary branch (and since your GitHub Action is configured to look for `main` or `master`), you can rename your local branch and then push it:\n\n```bash\n# Rename the current branch (test-opa-ci) to main\ngit branch -m test-opa-ci main\n\n# Push the main branch to GitHub\ngit push -u origin main\n```\n\n### Why did `master` fail?\nWhen you ran `git branch`, the output was `* test-opa-ci`. The `*` indicates your active branch. When you run `git push origin \u003cname\u003e`, Git expects `\u003cname\u003e` to be an existing branch in your local list. Because your repo was likely initialized with a different default name or you created a feature branch, `master` simply isn't there yet.\n\n\u003c!--\n[PROMPT_SUGGESTION]How do I create a Pull Request on GitHub after pushing my branch?[/PROMPT_SUGGESTION]\n[PROMPT_SUGGESTION]How can I check the status of my GitHub Actions workflow from the command line?[/PROMPT_SUGGESTION]\n--\u003e","chatSectionId":"8","ideContext":{"currentFile":{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.github/workflows/opa-ci.yml","language":"yaml","selection":{"start":1216,"end":1216},"includedReason":"CURRENTLY_OPEN","isUntitled":false},"remoteContexts":null,"remoteRepositories":[],"otherFiles":[{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pip/_internal/vcs/git.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE","isUntitled":false},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/datahub/configuration/git.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE","isUntitled":false},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/datahub/ingestion/source/git/git_import.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE","isUntitled":false},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.gemini/extensions/vertex/README.md","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE","isUntitled":false},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/datahub/cli/quickstart_versioning.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE","isUntitled":false},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pip/_internal/vcs/git.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE","isUntitled":false},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.gemini/extensions/vertex/README.md","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE","isUntitled":false},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.codeoss/data/User/globalStorage/googlecloudtools.datacloud/skill_bases/gcp-composer-troubleshooting/SKILL.md","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE","isUntitled"