kInfo":[{"historyItemId":"19918aeedf79c77","codeBlockIndex":0,"isCollapsed":false},{"historyItemId":"19918aeedf79c77","codeBlockIndex":1,"isCollapsed":false}],"modelDisplayName":"3 Flash Preview","modelID":"chat-gemini-3-0-flash-preview-free-tier","usageMetadata":{"promptTokenCount":65641,"candidatesTokenCount":790,"totalTokenCount":66431}},{"entity":"USER","markdownText":"still its the same issue .. i can see the compare and pull request button but when i click that its not showing me to create pull button ","chatSectionId":"12","ideContext":{"currentFile":{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.gitignore","language":"ignore","selection":{"start":42,"end":42},"includedReason":"CURRENTLY_OPEN","isUntitled":false},"remoteContexts":null,"remoteRepositories":[],"otherFiles":[{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.github/workflows/opa-ci.yml","language":"yaml","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"CHAT_SUGGESTED_EDIT","isUntitled":false},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/datahub/cli/docker_cli.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE","isUntitled":false},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.gemini/skills/building-data-apps/examples/react_chat_panel.jsx","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE","isUntitled":false},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.codeoss/data/User/globalStorage/googlecloudtools.datacloud/skill_bases/building-data-apps/examples/react_chat_panel.jsx","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE","isUntitled":false},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/datahub/utilities/partition_executor.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE","isUntitled":false},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pip/_vendor/urllib3/util/ssl_.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE","isUntitled":false},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pip/_internal/vcs/git.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE","isUntitled":false},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.gemini/extensions/vertex/README.md","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE","isUntitled":false},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/datahub/cli/docker_cli.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE","isUntitled":false},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/docker/api/image.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE","isUntitled":false},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pip/_internal/vcs/versioncontrol.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE","isUntitled":false}],"rules":null,"editableRegion":null,"recentUserActions":null,"chatSectionId":"12"},"agentMetadata":{"coderAgent":{"kind":""},"model":""},"id":"be6ee4d7-1667-47a1-8148-836092999031"},{"traceId":"c76e164f47036f02","entity":"SYSTEM","markdownText":"The reason you are seeing the **\"Compare \u0026 pull request\"** button but cannot actually complete the request is likely due to two things:\n\n1.  **Repository Clutter**: Your last push contained **7,622 files**, including a **99MB cache file**. GitHub's web interface often times out or fails to render the \"Create Pull Request\" page when a single branch contains thousands of unnecessary system/cache files.\n2.  **Missing Base Branch**: If `test-opa-ci` is the first and only branch you have pushed to GitHub, there is no `main` branch to compare it against. You cannot create a Pull Request if there is no target branch.\n\nTo fix this, we need to purge the cache files from your Git history and push this code as your `main` branch.\n\n### Step 1: Improve your .gitignore\nSince you are working in your home directory (`/home/mdbaddi`), we must explicitly tell Git to ignore system and configuration folders that were accidentally included.\n\n```diff\n--- a/home/mdbaddi/.gitignore\n+++ b/home/mdbaddi/.gitignore\n@@ -2,6 +2,10 @@\n # Cloud Shell / Cloud Code caches\n .cache/\n .google/\n+.local/\n+.config/\n+.ssh/\n+.bash*\n node_modules/\n __pycache__/\n *.log\n```\n\n### Step 2: Clean the Repository and Push to Main\nRun these commands in your Cloud Shell terminal. This will remove the ~7,000 unwanted files from your Git tracking and update GitHub with a clean `main` branch.\n\n```bash\n# 1. Remove everything from Git's tracking (this won't delete your files)\ngit rm -r --cached .\n\n# 2. Re-add everything (this time it will respect the updated .gitignore)\ngit add .\n\n# 3. Verify that you only see OPA and workflow files (should be a small number of files)\ngit status\n\n# 4. Commit the clean state\ngit commit -m \"Initial clean commit: Add OPA policies and CI/CD workflow\"\n\n# 5. Rename your local branch to main and force-push it to GitHub\ngit branch -m test-opa-ci main\ngit push -f origin main\n```\n\n### Why this fixes the issue:\n*   **Performance**: By reducing the file count from 7,600+ to just your relevant code, the GitHub UI will load instantly.\n*   **Default Branch**: Pushing to `main` establishes the default branch for your repository (`odp-runtime`). \n*   **Workflow Trigger**: Once you push to `main`, your **OPA CI/CD** workflow (defined in `.github/workflows/opa-ci.yml`) will trigger automatically because it is configured to run on `push` to `main`.\n\nAfter running these commands, go to the **Actions** tab on GitHub (`https://github.com/Manjuanthtek/odp-runtime/actions`). You should see your pipeline running successfully.\n\n\u003c!--\n[PROMPT_SUGGESTION]How can I check the GitHub Actions logs if the OPA Check fails?[/PROMPT_SUGGESTION]\n[PROMPT_SUGGESTION]How do I add a new Rego policy and test it in this setup?[/PROMPT_SUGGESTION]\n--\u003e","chatSectionId":"12","ideContext":{"currentFile":{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.gitignore","language":"ignore","selection"