ilure is due to the absence of a default branch like `main` on GitHub. This, combined with the large file issue, prevents the interface from appearing. My current strategy is to push my existing branch as the `main` branch after cleaning it.\n\n","id":"2bb3f2c2-3c41-4d49-9201-be7a8e7eadd2","agentMetadata":{"coderAgent":{"kind":""},"model":""},"modelDisplayName":"3 Flash Preview","modelID":"chat-gemini-3-0-flash-preview-free-tier","usageMetadata":{"promptTokenCount":68168,"candidatesTokenCount":730,"totalTokenCount":68898}}],"threadId":"feb2096d-b843-11f1-a27d-26ba507dde12","usageMetadata":{"promptTokenCount":68168,"candidatesTokenCount":730,"totalTokenCount":68898}}
